  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.2：修复泛型字典接口属性被写成 {\"Key\":..,\"Value\":..} 数组的问题，接口类型的集合/字典（IDictionary<TKey,TValue>、IReadOnlyDictionary<TKey,TValue>、IList<T>、ICollection<T>、IEnumerable<T> 等及非泛型 IDictionary/IList）现在可以反序列化并落到 Dictionary/List 默认实现，字典键按声明类型转换，IJsonObject 节点可原样写回。",
